cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use numgreen in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "numgreen: Numerical Green's Functions for Boundary-Based PDE Solvers"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/numgreen/numgreen"
authors:
  - name: "The numgreen contributors"
keywords:
  - Green's functions
  - boundary element method
  - finite element method
  - method of fundamental solutions
  - partial differential equations
  - numerical analysis
abstract: >-
  A Python library for approximating Green's functions of linear elliptic PDEs
  numerically and using them in boundary-based solvers such as BEM and MFS
  when closed-form fundamental solutions are unavailable.
